The following conventions are used in this Recommendation: – The keywords "should (is required to)" indicate a requirement which must be strictly followed and from which no deviation is permitted if conformance to this document is to be claimed;
– The keywords "can (is recommended to)" and "is recommended" indicate a requirement which is recommended but which is not absolutely required.
Thus this requirement needs not be present to claim conformance;
